<!--
  Pandora's own mark: the letter "P" of the wordmark, which is what the service's app icon carries
  on its own blue field. The path is the one Simple Icons publishes (CC0), like Spotify's, Deezer's
  and the rest of the set drawn from it - Pandora's art is a blue field with a white letter, and the
  letter alone is what a single-tint row can draw. The colour is the bright blue its own icon field
  is (#3668FF) rather than the darker hex the icon set publishes beside the path: at the row's size
  the darker blue reads as an empty plate on Hush's dark surface, which is the TIDAL problem in
  another colour.

  Written because this was the last source without a mark: the built-in list carries Pandora, so it
  appeared in Audio Sources next to twelve vendor marks while falling back to the generic note.
-->
